  message: "2026-11-23: re-ran the filed fixture (root tsconfig referencing ./pkg/tsconfig.json and ./pkg) on dev 1350a1d51 and on dev 49bc5c6e4 (after PR #2347): same result on both. The legacy ':tsconfig' kind, the fake 1-1 span and the dangling dst do NOT reproduce: the edge ends on json:./pkg/tsconfig.json:0-0:tsconfig.json:external_symbol, which is a node. The unresolved-path part DOES reproduce: pkg/tsconfig.json is a file node in the tree (json:pkg/tsconfig.json:1-3:tsconfig.json:file) and the edge does not end on it; ./pkg ends on json:./pkg:0-0:pkg:external_symbol. Which earlier PR removed the legacy kind was not determined. Status left unchanged; also listed in WI-lukid-romub-dodil-pogul-kuhah-donod-buvag-hifob."  # 4bef
